# Early stage — no compatibility

forma is not deployed. No production users or stable DSL v1 yet.

- Breaking API, ENV, and config shape changes are allowed.
- Do not add dual-write, dual-read, feature flags for old clients, or migration shims.
- Do not design for zero-downtime or rolling-deploy compatibility.
- Drop old paths. Rewrite in place.
- Stop citing "existing deployments" as a reason to keep a design.

See doc/ROADMAP.md for phased delivery.
